  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/icon-ioc/ICON_0013106">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A kind of data, or a format, the tool takes in, from the Data type list that also describes Data records, so data can be matched to the tools that take it. A specific Data record the tool uses is a uses data from link instead.</obo:IAO_0000115>
